---
title: "Card grid"
description: "Places a clickable card grid on the page"
type: static
---

## Basic card (src, href, alt)

{% card-grid %}
{% image-card href="/continuous_integration/pipelines/awscodepipeline/" src="logos/aws-codepipeline_small.svg" alt="aws codepipeline" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Card with title and subtitle

{% card-grid %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/datadog/" src="logos/dd_logo_n_70x75.png" alt="Datadog" title="Datadog" subtitle="The monitoring platform" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Title-only card (no src)

{% card-grid %}
{% image-card href="/getting_started/" title="Getting Started" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Card with tooltip

{% card-grid %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/aws/" src="logos/aws.svg" alt="AWS" tooltip="Amazon Web Services integration" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Cards inheriting image_width from card-grid

{% card-grid image_width=100 %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/gcp/" src="logos/google-cloud-platform.svg" alt="GCP" /%}
{% image-card href="/integrations/azure/" src="logos/azure.svg" alt="Azure" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Card overriding image_width

{% card-grid image_width=100 %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/datadog/" src="logos/dd_logo_n_70x75.png" alt="Datadog" image_width=200 /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Custom card_width

{% card-grid card_width=225 %}
